("v500", "scalar", "These questions take time. Comparing translations, reading the surrounding chapter, listening to informed disagreement and learning from people affected by a teaching can all expose something I missed. Difficulty is a reason to read more carefully. I should be able to say where the text ends and my interpretation begins.")
