("v561", "key", "attrs")
("v562", "type", "Record")
("v561", "value", "v562")
("v558", "entry", "v563")
("v563", "type", "Entry")
("v563", "key", "children")
("v564", "type", "Sequence")
("v565", "type", "String")
("v565", "scalar", "I want to ask what a teaching produces in practice: truthfulness, costly care, protection of the vulnerable, a willingness to repair harm. That examination must include Christian failures and goodness outside Christianity. Good consequences matter, but they cannot by themselves establish a religion’s historical or metaphysical claims. Equally, calling harm a spiritual lesson does not make the harm acceptable. ")
("v564", "item", "v565")
